flowchart TB
Review[Reviewed change and classified sources] --> CI[GitHub-hosted public CI]
CI --> Tests[Contracts security tests browser builds]
Tests --> Stage[Authorized isolated staging]
Stage --> Hosted[Revision logs readiness and workflows]
Hosted --> Gate[Release gate and owner authorization]
Gate --> Production[Production promotion only after approval]
Tests --> Docs[Classified public docs artifact]
Docs --> DGate[Independent docs release verification]
DGate --> Vercel[Separate public docs Vercel project]
Rollback[Retained source artifact migration compatibility] --> Production
